{"id":"wenn","lemma":"wenn","pos":"conj","rank":29,"glosses":["when, whenever","if (on the condition that)"],"ipa":"/vɛn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d4/De-wenn2.ogg/De-wenn2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wenn nicht jetzt, wann dann?","en":"If not now, then when?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700168","words":[null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"then, after that"}]},{"text":"Wenn Sie wollen, können Sie gehen.","en":"You can go if you want.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759629","words":[null,{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to want"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Was, wenn sie mich nicht mögen?","en":"What if they don't like me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698714","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to like"}]},{"text":"Komm, wenn du kannst!","en":"Come if you can.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/177115","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"}]},{"text":"Ich mag es, wenn du das tust.","en":"I like it when you do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700193","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"}]}]}